1: # Test-support observation requirements
2: 
3: Task P100-004/P100-024/SBX-METADATA-OBS-003, T2 only. Judge real public source factory single_pass observations with synthetic external ports and a memory-only pure echo. No production code, public contract, policy, identity, approval, SQL, lockfile or engines may be changed. Native containment, production policy, compiled ABI, managed lifecycle ML29, two-engine/full parity and release remain unproven. Human220/221/222pending; no new permission inferred.
4: 
5: OBS-SBX01: directWORKSPACE deny gate exactly once, bodyzero, UNSAFE_REQUEST. OBS-SBX02: capabilityNONE no gate, onebody/COMPLETED, nomodel/approval. OBS-SBX03: record target capabilityWORKSPACE preservation or loss truthfully, source wiring real, never infer sandboxPASS fromprocess exit0. OBS-SBX04: verify source and run membership/digests from externally pinned authority and independently supplied capture receipt; no self-trusting checksum. Reject malformed/lost/forged native fields, logs, telemetry, causal identity, fingerprints, numeric types/duplicate JSON, process/environment/duration/streams and unknown teardown. A receipt binds an honestly captured exact run, not arbitrary hostile host/code provenance. Semantic copied-record negatives must exercise meaning beyond checksums, with explicitly test-only receipts that are not accepted actual captures. OBS-SBX05: immutable source, focused type/lint/format, two native observations plus trustedchild deadline/output/read/snapshot fault paths, current independent review and globalpending limits.
6: 
7: Launcher original source1054+newtestsupport now1061paths, no transitive compiled/native qualification. Runtime deadline5s absolute across EOF/join; cleanup separately bounded; cap1MiB retained; alwayscleanup/persist partialfailure in finally; private per-run homes and caches disabled. No copied runtime implementation, monkeypatch of engine, native helper, provider/network/service/PG/realdata. Synthetic fixed lifecycle children only stdio/timers/closing own FDs; never run externally supplied code/argv from data. Source authority/receipt expected SHA are Lead/operator parameters outside observation JSON. Keep chronological and capture limits truthful.
8: 
9: For the fixed local fixture, a denied/non-dispatched tool has telemetry.toolDurationMs exactly zero. Successful journal createdAt<=updatedAt<=turn-end audit timestamp. Any clock anomaly is invalid/inconclusive for this evidence, never normalized into success. Retain raw clocks and authenticate actual capture with external receipt. These refinements do not claim universal distributed clock ordering.
